  "solution": "By using BODMAS and going by the options\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a6de2237baa6a136d4e3a2250fb0c2a03851586d845332e49e0ff412217f85fb.png] \n\n**Given Equation :- 17*4*63*7*21*3*59**\n\nInterchanging * with signs\n\n**Option (1) ×, +, ÷, -, +, =**\n\n⇒ 17 × 4 + __**63 ÷ 7**__ - 21 + 3 = 59\n\n⇒ __**17 × 4**__ + 9 - 21 + 3 = 59 \n\n⇒ **68 + 9** - 21** + 3** = 59\n\n⇒ 80 - 21 = 59 \n\n**⇒ 59 = 59 **\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option(2) =, -, ×, +, -, ÷**\n\n⇒ 17 = 4 - 63 × 7 + 21 - 3 ÷ 59\n\n⇒ 17 = 4 - 63 × 7 + 21 - 0.0508\n\n⇒ 17 = 4 - 441 + 21 - 0.0508\n\n⇒ 17 = 25 - 441 - 0.0508\n\n⇒ 17 = - 416.0508\n\n**⇒ LHS ≠ RHS **\n\n**Option(3) -, ×, +, =, ÷, -**\n\n⇒ 17 - 4 × 63 + 7 = 21 ÷ 3 - 59\n\n⇒ 17 - 4 × 63 + 7 = 7 -59\n\n⇒ 17 - 252 + 7 = - 52\n\n⇒ -252 + 24 = - 52\n\n⇒ - 228 = - 52\n\n**⇒ LHS ≠ RHS **\n\n**Option(4) =, -, ×, +, ÷, -**\n\n⇒ 17 = 4 - 63 × 7 + 21 ÷ 3 - 59\n\n⇒ 17 = 4 - 63 × 7 + 7 - 59\n\n⇒ 17 = 4 - 441 + 7 - 59\n\n⇒ 17 = 11 - 441 - 59\n\n⇒ 17 = 11 - 500\n\n⇒ 17 = - 489\n\n**⇒ LHS ≠ RHS **\n\nTherefore, only option(1) satisfies the above equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is** option(1)**",
